<title>POLAND: GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 41.1 AND 37.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 41.1 AND 37.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two kerb transactions of 58,829 shares and 20,500 shares in Poland's Bank Gdanski at 41.1 zlotys and 37 zlotys respectively were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Gdanski fell 2.2 percent to 40.2 zlotys in a volume of 12,581 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
